OL,3,GNEWSAEndangered dormice on farm signal
OL,4,Ahealthy landscape
OL,5,
OL,6,FEndangered dormice have been found on a
OL,7,Ffarm that has been working to improve
OL,8,Fbiodiversity and nature habitats.
OL,10,FBabers Farm in Marshwood, near
OL,11,FBridport, Dorset, is under the
OL,12,Fstewardship of the Countryside
OL,13,FRegeneration Trust (CRT), which seeks
OL,14,Fto create nature-friendly farms.
OL,16,FHazel dormice are a European Protected
OL,17,FSpecies and are considered vulnerable
OL,18,Fto extinction, but their presence is a
OL,19,Fmarker of a healthy, well-connected
OL,20,Flandscape.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
